      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "97ef80ba_3bb5d657",
        "filename": "radio/1.2/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 346,
      "author": {
        "id": 1244217
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-16T22:17:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m basing it off of the old lceData struct. I don\u0027t know why they limited it to 0-100. @nharold can you comment?\n\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/aosp-master/hardware/interfaces/radio/1.0/types.hal?dr\u0026q\u003dconfidence+file:%5Ehardware/interfaces/radio/+package:%5Eaosp-master$\u0026l\u003d1832",
      "parentUuid": "c9f403c9_6e025363",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 79
      },
      "revId": "755142893c018d4fac6fef5c839c280c439303a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d343a89f_90dbdf89",
        "filename": "radio/1.2/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 346,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-16T22:40:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was not involved in the design of the original LCE API, and I\u0027d be surprised if there\u0027s a strong technical rationale for 1-100. Perhaps because it\u0027s \"confidence\", which the designers though of as a % with 100% being the highest confidence. Since more than 3-4 values is probably beyond the level of practical granularity 1-100 is already over-specified. I\u0027m not in favor of changing it unless there\u0027s any practical value, and I don\u0027t see any. If we did it all again, I probably would have made it 0 to 3, but... c\u0027est la vie  :-)",
      "parentUuid": "97ef80ba_3bb5d657",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 79
      },
      "revId": "755142893c018d4fac6fef5c839c280c439303a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b0325d36_5c4bce8f",
        "filename": "radio/1.2/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 346,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-16T23:26:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree this is too much granularity without guidance for callers or implemenators.  We run the risk of either doing to much work to refine the confidence level (burning battery for nothing) or too little and getting garbage.  The only utility I see is getting a threshold beyond which the info is too tenuous to be useful.  There may be several transition points between useless and useful, depending on the usecase for the data, but without understanding of what the confidence means apps can really rely on that level of precision.\n\nI\u0027d be inclined to not include confidence at this point.  If we get a good reason and can define it well we can add it in the future.",
      "parentUuid": "d343a89f_90dbdf89",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 79
      },
      "revId": "755142893c018d4fac6fef5c839c280c439303a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bd9634cb_ba951acd",
        "filename": "radio/1.2/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 346,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-16T23:33:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@Robert, I think we want confidence. I just don\u0027t think we need 100 levels. I was inclined to leave it because it\u0027s already what exists for downlink. I\u0027ll create a doc offline on how I think we should use it, and perhaps we can discuss with some of our vendor partners to see if we can make at least set some standard guidelines without taking away room to innovate (there is plenty of opportunity to innovate here).",
      "parentUuid": "b0325d36_5c4bce8f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 79
      },
      "revId": "755142893c018d4fac6fef5c839c280c439303a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
